s of infected guerilla warriors in the Northwestern Tundra. Their richer combat experience and synergy with other Yeti Squadron members make them pose an immense threat to frozen Operators.","abilities":["Attack power increases when attacking Frozen targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":360,"def":100,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.4}},"yeti_caster_leader":{"slug":"yeti_caster_leader","name":"Yeti Caster Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Yeti Caster Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"An elite caster of the Yeti Squadron hailing from teams of infected guerilla warriors in the Northwestern Tundra, boasting greater combat capabilities. Through special Arts and devices, they can inflict Cold on our Operators, reducing their attack speed and making them vulnerable to being Frozen.","abilities":["After two attacks, the next attack applies the Cold effect"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":400,"def":250,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"mortar_gunner_leader":{"slug":"mortar_gunner_leader","name":"Mortar Gunner Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mortar Gunner Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Reunion's special ranged soldiers, more dangerous than a normal Mortar Gunner. Equipped with pilfered military-grade Originium launchers, they launch explosive attacks from hard-to-defend positions, making them a significant threat to back-line Operators.","abilities":["Capable of extremely long ranged-attacks","Shells deal area damage to target and any allied units in the surrounding 8 tiles"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"m